---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../../components/editorial/SectionLabel.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<Layout title="Legal identity & boundaries | Trustora" description="Trustora's published legal identity and service boundaries." currentPath="/legal/entities/">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="measure page-hero-grid">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <SectionLabel>Legal / Identity</SectionLabel>
        <h1>A clear operating identity.</h1>
        <p>Trust is easier to build when the entity, the service boundary, and the unanswered questions are visible.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-note">This page publishes only facts approved for Trustora's public website. It is not a substitute for country-specific legal, tax, immigration, or employment advice.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cream-field">
    <div class="measure legal-layout">
      <aside><SectionLabel>Published identity</SectionLabel></aside>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>{site.legalName}</h2>
        <p>{site.legalName} is a company established in {site.jurisdiction}. Trustora provides employment administration and coordination, including Employer of Record and related specialist talent, payroll, people operations, and workplace services through written engagement terms.</p>
        <h2>What this does—and does not—mean</h2>
        <p>Trustora's service reach may involve clients, employees, and local partners in more than one country. That service reach should not be read as a claim that Trustora maintains a separate legal entity, employment license, registered office, insurance policy, or immigration practice in every country described on this site.</p>
        <p>Trustora provides employment administration and coordination. Country-specific legal, tax, immigration, and employment advice may require qualified local professionals. Country-specific obligations are reviewed against the facts of an engagement.</p>
        <h2>Information we will add only when approved</h2>
        <p>Registration numbers, registered-office details, tax identifiers, insurance information, country-specific licenses, and formal partner descriptions will be published here only after the underlying documents and wording are approved for public use.</p>
        <p>For a potential engagement, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or <a href="/contact/">start an intake</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
